                "control-id": "control.ict_risk_framework_review-v1",
                "description": "Establish, document and maintain a sound, comprehensive and well-documented ICT risk-management framework that is part of the overall risk-management system, is reviewed at least annually and upon the occurrence of major ICT-related incidents, and is subject to audit by ICT auditors on a regular basis.",
